        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O tondũ nĩ thayu, easya Mwĩaĩi Yeova, vate ndĩi vandũ vala mũsumbĩ wĩkalaa ũla wamũtw’ĩkĩthisye mũsumbĩ, ũla wavũthisye wĩvĩto wake, na ũla wanangie ũtianĩo wake, e nake ku Mbaviloni katĩ akakw’a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O na Valao ndakamũtethya kaũnĩ na ĩta syake syĩ vinya na nguthu yake nene, yĩla makomba mbumbu na kwaka ngome, mavete andũ aingĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
